      "; .point [.v 1; .set_ {@v _;}];",
      "; point.set_ 2",
      "# [.v 2; .set_ { @v _; };]",
      "; [(point.set_ 2) & {_}, (point.set_ 2) = [.v 2; .set_ {@v _;}]]",
      "# [[], <>]",
      "",
      "`A bare sibling mutator remains functional inside a non-mutating method.`",
